                    "source": "PubMed",
                    "id": "18195351"
                  }
                ],
                "value": "In early embryos before gastrulation, it is specifically expressed in the distal-most part of the extraembryonic ectoderm, adjacent to the epiblast. Expression is highly restricted to the developing pharyngeal endoderm and mesonephros until day 11.5 of embryogenesis"
